    "segments": [
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0001",
        "startMs": 0,
        "endMs": 3500,
        "text": "大家好，今天我们来讨论一下API性能优化的方案。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0002",
        "startMs": 3600,
        "endMs": 7200,
        "text": "嗯，我们发现最近的API响应时间有点慢。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0003",
        "startMs": 7300,
        "endMs": 11000,
        "text": "是的，特别是在高峰期，P95延迟已经超过了500ms。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0004",
        "startMs": 11100,
        "endMs": 14500,
        "text": "我们需要从几个方面着手优化。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0005",
        "startMs": 14600,
        "endMs": 18200,
        "text": "首先是数据库查询优化，我们可以添加更多的索引。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0006",
        "startMs": 18300,
        "endMs": 22100,
        "text": "对吧，这个应该能带来比较显著的性能提升。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0007",
        "startMs": 22200,
        "endMs": 26500,
        "text": "其次，我们应该在应用层面实现缓存策略。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0008",
        "startMs": 26600,
        "endMs": 30800,
        "text": "我们可以使用Redis来缓存热点数据。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0009",
        "startMs": 30900,
        "endMs": 34200,
        "text": "嗯，这个想法不错。我们怎么样实现这个呢？",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0010",
        "startMs": 34300,
        "endMs": 38500,
        "text": "首先，我们需要定义缓存的key和过期时间。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0011",
        "startMs": 38600,
        "endMs": 42300,
        "text": "对，我建议采用一个统一的缓存管理策略。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0012",
        "startMs": 42400,
        "endMs": 46100,
        "text": "我们还可以考虑使用CDN来加速静态资源。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0013",
        "startMs": 46200,
        "endMs": 50500,
        "text": "对的，这样可以减少服务器的负担。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0014",
        "startMs": 50600,
        "endMs": 54800,
        "text": "设计团队这边有什么想法吗？",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0015",
        "startMs": 54900,
        "endMs": 58200,
        "text": "从用户体验的角度来看，我们可能还需要优化前端的加载性能。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0016",
        "startMs": 58300,
        "endMs": 62500,
        "text": "是的，我们可以实现代码分割和懒加载。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0017",
        "startMs": 62600,
        "endMs": 66900,
        "text": "QA这边的测试计划是什么？",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0018",
        "startMs": 67000,
        "endMs": 71200,
        "text": "我们需要制定详细的性能测试计划，包括负载测试和压力测试。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0019",
        "startMs": 71300,
        "endMs": 75500,
        "text": "对的，我们需要在各个优化阶段进行基准测试。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0020",
        "startMs": 75600,
        "endMs": 79800,
        "text": "那么，我们定一个timeline吧。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0021",
        "startMs": 79900,
        "endMs": 83200,
        "text": "数据库优化预计需要两个星期。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0022",
        "startMs": 83300,
        "endMs": 87500,
        "text": "缓存策略的实现应该需要一到两个星期。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0023",
        "startMs": 87600,
        "endMs": 91800,
        "text": "CDN集成可能需要三到五天。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0024",
        "startMs": 91900,
        "endMs": 95200,
        "text": "前端优化我们预计需要一个星期。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0025",
        "startMs": 95300,
        "endMs": 99500,
        "text": "测试应该贯穿整个优化过程。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0026",
        "startMs": 99600,
        "endMs": 103800,
        "text": "好的，我们规划这个任务分配给各个团队。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0027",
        "startMs": 103900,
        "endMs": 107200,
        "text": "Alice负责数据库和缓存部分。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "id": "asr-seg-0028",
        "startMs": 107300,
        "endMs": 111500,
        "text": "Bob负责CDN集成和基础设施部分。",
        "language": "zh",
        "confidence": 0.94
